[{"title":"田熙载比失解留诗别承之殿撰承之用其韵以宠其行如璧亦次其韵","author":"饶节","text":"田侯蕴藉绝凡尘，常苦冥冥天胜人。\n可但渊源深孔孟，更无学术略仪秦。\n且寻耒耨聊糊口，未置文章便稳身。\n幸有使君敦眷旧，转令名字落簪绅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58818,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扪虱新篱","author":"饶节","text":"瓮牖近山巅，人言阙短垣。\n聊须安虎落，未免伐龙孙。\n留路依松罅，埋椿避石根。\n从今有来客，道得始开门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58819,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵湛老菖蒲二首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"溪渌渠无数，窗奁此独幽。\n蘋繁惟祭祀，杨柳谩风流。\n根抱千年老，苗舒一寸柔。\n内刚还外顺，不对道人羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58820,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵湛老菖蒲二首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"永辞寒涧密，来作宝坊幽。\n著脚非危石，退身曾急流。\n江芦强刚愎，野蔓太优柔。\n会有仙人食，王公未敢羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58821,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘仲高仪曹左顾林下重话十年之别作诗见赠次韵","author":"饶节","text":"下马疑高韵，披襟记旧游。\n从头推故迹，屈指尽名流。\n安否何劳问，行藏不用筹。\n夜阑重换烛，群吏且前休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58822,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵","author":"饶节","text":"四海班扬誉，平生支许游。\n芝兰端秀润，杨柳未风流。\n异日玉堂草，何年石室筹。\n愿公随处用，择地岂真休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58823,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居杂颂七首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"几被儒冠误此身，偶然随分作闲人。\n二时粥饭随堂饱，长短高低一任君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58824,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居杂颂七首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"石楠子熟雪微乾，曾向人家画里看。\n觌面似君君未领，问君何处有遮栏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58825,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居杂颂七首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"禅堂茶退卷残经，竹杖芒鞋信脚行。\n山尽路回人迹绝，竹鸡时作两三声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58826,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居杂颂七首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"溪边小立听溪声，日到溪心衮衮明。\n独木自横人不渡，隔溪黄犊转头鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58827,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居杂颂七首 其五","author":"饶节","text":"华严台上平如掌，自是游人路不通。\n要识普贤真境界，乱山如浪涌云中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58828,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居杂颂七首 其六","author":"饶节","text":"律师持律笑禅寂，禅客参禅笑律拘。\n禅律二途俱不涉，几个男儿是丈夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58829,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居杂颂七首 其七","author":"饶节","text":"数日春晴退水痕，落花如抱拥藤根。\n过尽游人浑不见，又随波浪下前村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58830,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再送不愚兄二首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"摇头摆尾赤梢鲤，当年一跃过龙门。\n诸方若要知来处，的的云门七代孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58831,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再送不愚兄二首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"今代识真人已少，纷纷鱼目乱骊珠。\n兄持万古连城璧，只可深藏莫似渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58832,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送本觉上座","author":"饶节","text":"宝山亲到宜著力，只为人情空手回。\n路上逢人如借问，莫言曾见德山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58833,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜜蜂颂四首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"不辞倾倒为君甜，只要教君脱旧粘。\n眨上眉毛还蹉过，莫令唇齿带廉纤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58834,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜜蜂颂四首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"非但桃花与杏花，万家春色总吾家。\n花须造化无人会，月落空庭竹影斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58835,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜜蜂颂四首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"三尺刳桐表里浑，个中特地好乾坤。\n禅流不用窥门户，却怕针锋著面门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58836,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜜蜂颂四首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"渠家世代恶儿孙，激箭机锋不易亲。\n闹处逢人遭一剳，可怜多少负恩人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58837,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝志禅师梁天监中将入寂然一烛付后阁舍人吴庆庆以事闻帝叹曰大师不复留矣烛者将以后事嘱我乎颂","author":"饶节","text":"已是梁王不识真，末后殷勤付舍人。\n柳花飞尽莺犹语，独对钟山指暮云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58838,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵护公首座赞广德磨衲升座五首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"碧眼传来浪得名，老卢持去更喧争。\n宝严自有新磨衲，不动烟尘度四生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58839,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵护公首座赞广德磨衲升座五首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"百衲新披膝按藤，众魔从此息纷争。\n笑他鸡足峰前客，犹自区区待下生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58840,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵护公首座赞广德磨衲升座五首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"诸天行乐正峥嵘，八臂修罗苦战争。\n谁似万桐山下老，提撕磨衲示无生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58841,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵护公首座赞广德磨衲升座五首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"众身卑小总难胜，挂向师身恰不争。\n大地山河皆里许，衲僧眨眼太迟生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58842,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵护公首座赞广德磨衲升座五首 其五","author":"饶节","text":"拥衲垂慈矜不能，每逢魔外直须争。\n人来若问新鲜句，木女怀儿昨夜生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58843,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送浃上座如馀杭刻慈觉老人语录五首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"扬子江头水拍天，导师曾此应机缘。\n浑金璞玉公收拾，付与知音万古传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58844,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送浃上座如馀杭刻慈觉老人语录五首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"四十九年无一字，少林面壁太忉忉。\n世人未会个中意，试把遗编读一遭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58845,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送浃上座如馀杭刻慈觉老人语录五首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"啾啾蚊蚋盎中鸣，拟议庄周旧典刑。\n好与刻成无字印，须弥顶上震雷霆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58846,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送浃上座如馀杭刻慈觉老人语录五首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"时人浩浩说无言，政使无言恰是边。\n若道阿师能答话，五刑何止更三千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58847,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送浃上座如馀杭刻慈觉老人语录五首 其五","author":"饶节","text":"受持法藏不辞烦，如水传瓶有阿难。\n已得当年末后句，旃檀林里自旃檀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58848,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蔡伯世吕隆礼敦智李肃老求颂二首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"稻麻竹苇学禅人，四子年来意甚真。\n却是个中相为切，木鱼光里现三身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58849,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蔡伯世吕隆礼敦智李肃老求颂二首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"文章于道未为尊，争似无为实相门。\n要做仲尼真弟子，须参达磨的儿孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58850,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶作","author":"饶节","text":"丹霞到了被人谩，选佛何曾异选官。\n争似白云无事客，茅檐冬日卧蒲团。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58851,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"腊月八日送尘禅者往长芦","author":"饶节","text":"当年达磨度芦处，今日如来成道时。\n此处此时聊赠别，不求佛祖是男儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58852,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送池州诸化士四首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"禅家妙用似孙吴，奇正相生非一途。\n若见施银甘行者，须教红焰起冰壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58853,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送池州诸化士四首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"独行如犀未足嘉，廛中随处自那伽。\n多应平等随缘度，岂必王侯将相家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58854,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送池州诸化士四首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"非朝非市亦非山，万顷江头旧祖关。\n七百道人同一钵，付君分卫到人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58855,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送池州诸化士四首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"如闻大匠构明堂，自有儿孙作栋梁。\n今日著衣持钵去，东风残雪野梅香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58856,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答惇上人七首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"平生跌荡坐穷诗，今日论诗似旧时。\n第一义中无适莫，为君重赋楚人辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58857,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答惇上人七首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"因君撩我强题诗，却忆当年梦里时。\n不识江南好风景，采蘋人唱鹧鸪辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58858,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答惇上人七首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"朝学中庸暮学诗，晚年长忆蚤年时。\n如今老大浑彫落，稍欲从君理系辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58859,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答惇上人七首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"少矜平子四愁诗，晚学赵州十二时。\n千里故人不解事，书来犹寄竹枝辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58860,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答惇上人七首 其五","author":"饶节","text":"漫说一言能蔽诗，五千同具刹那时。\n向来可与言诗者，得志方能不害辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58861,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答惇上人七首 其六","author":"饶节","text":"铁面禅师骂学诗，为怜虚度太平时。\n须知十万八千偈，不比人间绝妙辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58862,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答惇上人七首 其七","author":"饶节","text":"非是谈禅非说诗，相逢无处亦无时。\n炉烟趺坐对终日，旧社知音去不辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58863,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中同无求游龙山胜相观丈六金铜像历诸小刹无求作诗纪事次其韵三首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"细雨无烟昼不开，杖藜同访古如来。\n声求色见无非道，举似时人一任猜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58864,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中同无求游龙山胜相观丈六金铜像历诸小刹无求作诗纪事次其韵三首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"芒鞋印雨涉泥行，谁是官人谁是僧。\n我已无心慕支遁，君今宁复愧孙登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58865,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中同无求游龙山胜相观丈六金铜像历诸小刹无求作诗纪事次其韵三首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"剥啄敲门惊隙尘，开门随处得清新。\n独怜桂子花开处，不见题诗病道人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58866,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上竺知客肇师示苏仲豫参寥唱和韫秀堂二绝句求和因追次其韵二首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"光明奇秀岂能藏，草自纤柔桧自长。\n不待博山荐沉水，道人亲佩法身香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58867,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上竺知客肇师示苏仲豫参寥唱和韫秀堂二绝句求和因追次其韵二首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"休话纷纷故恼渠，似持钟鼓乐爰居。\n西来未欲深藏迹，人境聊须暂结庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58868,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"师节受业师慈慧公喜草书得海老琴诀之妙以医隐于会稽比以草书四诗招师节归山师节次其韵报之余亦为赋四首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"弦上平生要妙声，只知求古不求名。\n遥怜月下无人处，满写千秋万古情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58869,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"师节受业师慈慧公喜草书得海老琴诀之妙以医隐于会稽比以草书四诗招师节归山师节次其韵报之余亦为赋四首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"肘后神方济物深，得之于手应之心。\n好山不惜能分客，岁晚当容支道林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58870,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"师节受业师慈慧公喜草书得海老琴诀之妙以医隐于会稽比以草书四诗招师节归山师节次其韵报之余亦为赋四首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"平生春蚓秋蛇手，他日阳春白雪歌。\n况有古灵归论道，似师此乐世无多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58871,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"师节受业师慈慧公喜草书得海老琴诀之妙以医隐于会稽比以草书四诗招师节归山师节次其韵报之余亦为赋四首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"百战将军老不衰，年来白发渐垂垂。\n稽山自古多嘉遁，不为鲈鱼更好归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58872,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送印大师参灵峰卿老","author":"饶节","text":"四海无家一道人，云山未肯便安身。\n冷泉亭畔腰包去，芝草峰边更问津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58873,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乞石菖蒲","author":"饶节","text":"香绿茸茸一寸根，清泉白石共寒温。\n道人好事能分我，留取斓斑旧藓痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58874,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜜蜂","author":"饶节","text":"风雨萧萧早晚天，放衙时节也随缘。\n晨参暮请真丛席，不似痴人更说禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58875,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赠高致虚四首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"向来桃李恰随流，策策风枝又作秋。\n但得相如完璧去，何妨季子敝貂游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58876,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赠高致虚四首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"意君剑履上青云，岂谓相逢犹问津。\n柱后惠文如束湿，何妨且作自由人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58877,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赠高致虚四首 其三","author":"饶节","text":"闻君小隐近山溪，野水平桥竹绕篱。\n名利区中无此妙，不须辛苦问蓍龟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58878,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赠高致虚四首 其四","author":"饶节","text":"灵隐冷泉天下奇，与君同俯碧琉璃。\n更寻天竺上下寺，休问荀杨大小疵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58879,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送通上人为长芦行乞","author":"饶节","text":"白蘋风作蓼花秋，万顷寒涛卷底流。\n八百道人禅定起，送君持钵上行舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58880,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送玘上人","author":"饶节","text":"文章小技竟何须，富贵浮云付与渠。\n衲子平生一拄杖，从来不用护身符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58881,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢人送石菖蒲","author":"饶节","text":"我有随身万斛泉，解令平地涌溅溅。\n一寸菖蒲十二节，谢师连石送泉边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58882,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长老欲敲去竹枝透风作凉以颂止之","author":"饶节","text":"寒梢展尽玉玲珑，细叶斜枝翠几重。\n何必敲开损高节，此君元自有清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58883,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题宗子赵明叔盘车图后","author":"饶节","text":"跌宕平生万里程，盘车一展老心惊。\n溪昏树暗牛争力，似听当年风雨声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58884,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉上示众","author":"饶节","text":"凫雁纷纷不自由，往来长为稻粱谋。\n令人却忆辽天鹤，万里无云汉水秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58885,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王通判雪中来访以颂谢之","author":"饶节","text":"料峭严风雪满山，驼裘絮帽叩松关。\n知公不减王子敬，乘兴何妨见戴还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58886,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双池通老以笋见遗发之皆腐矣作颂戏之","author":"饶节","text":"竹雏何事出山迟，据案开缄谩朵颐。\n闻道苍筤三十万，可能浑长化龙枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58887,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闰老求席因以戏之","author":"饶节","text":"百丈曾于堂上卷，赵州只向日中铺。\n赠师七尺高低具，尚打当年鼓笛无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58888,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢洞山和尚惠蒌蒿种","author":"饶节","text":"等推三界纳秋毫，错被人呼世外高。\n已办绿蓑青蒻笠，溟濛烟雨掐蒌蒿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58889,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾伯容梅诗二首 其一","author":"饶节","text":"气压春工千万枝，洒然开我合琉璃。\n知渠有美自难禁，不待雪深风劲时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58890,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾伯容梅诗二首 其二","author":"饶节","text":"欲开不开香满枝，小池枝映碧琉璃。\n岭头功德真相似，不点光明待几时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58891,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]